  "details": "I understand duplicate posts might be ignored but this is a feature that will impact a whole new full body tracking technology (IMU based) and make it much easier for us to get in VR as well as maybe some other niche vr tech (mocap suit??) or even standard vive/tundra users.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-ik-20/p/save-calibration-between-sessions-so-crashes-are-less-trouble\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/save-full-body-calibration-when-closing-crashing-the-game-benefits-imu-based-tra\n\ncmon... add full body tracker calibration saving q.q",
